# TCP Protocol Analysis: Understanding the Three-Way Handshake

## Objective
The objective of this lab was to analyze the TCP protocol and understand how the three-way handshake establishes a reliable connection between two hosts. The lab also focused on identifying handshake packets in Wireshark and understanding their relevance in a SOC environment.

