## Methodology

### 1. Started Packet Capture
- Opened Wireshark.
- Selected active network interface.
- Began capturing live traffic.

### 2. Generated TCP Traffic
- Accessed a website using a web browser.
- This triggered TCP communication between client and server.

### 3. Applied Display Filter
Used the following display filter to isolate TCP traffic:

tcp

To focus specifically on SYN packets:

tcp.flags.syn == 1 && tcp.flags.ack == 0

To identify SYN-ACK responses:

tcp.flags.syn == 1 && tcp.flags.ack == 1


### 4. Identified the Three-Way Handshake
- Located SYN packet from client.
- Located SYN-ACK from server.
- Located final ACK from client.
- Verified sequence and acknowledgment numbers.

